WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.800
ThanksLiving is Thanksgiving with a fully plant-based table.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.300
Same family, same gratitude, nobody harmed.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.920
On this page you'll find a few easy ideas to make it yours,

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.060
whether you host or bring one dish.
